{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;On your first day working as a caregiver in one of the most remote <strong>infirmaries</strong> in the region, you are assigned the night shift, the only one available. Little do you know, some things here are not what they seem.&quot;</i><br><br><i></i><br><br><strong>About the Game</strong><br><br><i>You will be playing as a new caregiver who has just arrived in town, experiencing her first night in an old remote infirmary, and the darkness feels alive, watching, waiting. Little do you know, this will become a matter of life and death.</i><br><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i></i></u><br><u><i></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a young caregiver newly arrived in town.<br>What should be a routine overnight shift quickly turns into a struggle for survival as the infirmary reveals its secrets.<br>Experience a tense, story-driven night where every creak and shadow could be your last.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror</strong> \u2013 Explore a lonely, decaying infirmary where silence is rarely safe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short but Unforgettable</strong> \u2013 A compact narrative experience that can be completed in under an hour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong> \u2013 Easy to learn so you can focus on the fear.<i></i><br><br><i></i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596280/extras/a4ce64bab45008b039f3c23574667719.avif?t=1758928369\" width=1128 height=626 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls (Default)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse</strong> \u2013 Look around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD</strong> \u2013 Move</p></li>